<section class="uniko-page uniko-policy-page">
  {% if page.handle == 'return-and-refund' or page.handle == 'returns-and-refunds' or page.handle == 'return-refund' %}
    <h1 data-i18n="returns_title">Returns & refunds</h1>
    <p data-i18n="returns_intro">If an Uniko Beauties order is not right, you can ask for a return within the time below. Write to us before you send anything back.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="returns_h_window">Time limit</h2>
    <p data-i18n="returns_window">You have 14 days from the day the order arrives to request a return.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="returns_h_eligible">What we accept</h2>
    <p data-i18n="returns_eligible">The product must be unused and unopened, in its original packaging, with the seal intact. Include your order number.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="returns_h_not">What we cannot take back</h2>
    <p data-i18n="returns_not">Opened or used hair, face, beard and body products cannot be returned, for hygiene. A product damaged by use after opening is not refunded.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="returns_h_damaged">Damaged or wrong item</h2>
    <p data-i18n="returns_damaged">If the parcel arrives damaged or leaking, or the product is not what you ordered, contact us within 2 days with your order number and photos. We replace the item or refund it, and we cover the return.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="returns_h_how">How to ask for a return</h2>
    <p data-i18n="returns_how">Send your order number by email or WhatsApp. We confirm whether the return is accepted and tell you the next step. Do not post the parcel until we confirm.</p>
    <p class="uniko-policy-contact">
      <a href="mailto:unikobeautie@gmail.com">unikobeautie@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/22390358545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+223 90 35 85 45</a>
    </p>

    <h2 data-i18n="returns_h_refund">Refunds</h2>
    <p data-i18n="returns_refund">After we receive and check the return, the refund goes back to the original payment method within 14 days. Delivery fees you paid are refunded only when the mistake is ours. Return postage is yours to pay, unless the item is damaged, wrong or faulty.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="returns_h_shipping">Free delivery</h2>
    <p data-i18n="returns_shipping">Delivery is free on orders over €95. If a partial return brings the order under €95, the delivery amount can be taken off the refund.</p>
  {% elsif page.handle == 'terms-of-services' or page.handle == 'terms-of-service' or page.handle == 'terms' %}
    <h1 data-i18n="terms_title">Terms of service</h1>
    <p data-i18n="terms_updated">Last updated 25 November 2026.</p>
    <p data-i18n="terms_intro">These terms cover shopping on the Uniko Beauties website. By placing an order, you agree to them.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="terms_h_store">The store</h2>
    <p data-i18n="terms_store">Uniko Beauties sells botanical hair, face, beard and body products. Questions go to the email or WhatsApp below.</p>
    <p class="uniko-policy-contact">
      <a href="mailto:unikobeautie@gmail.com">unikobeautie@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/22390358545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+223 90 35 85 45</a>
    </p>

    <h2 data-i18n="terms_h_orders">Orders</h2>
    <p data-i18n="terms_orders">An order is confirmed when you receive the order email. We may cancel an order if a product is out of stock, the payment does not go through, or the details look incorrect. If we cancel, you are not charged, or any payment already taken is refunded.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="terms_h_prices">Prices and payment</h2>
    <p data-i18n="terms_prices">The price on the product page is the price before checkout. The amount at checkout is the amount you pay, including any delivery fee shown there. We can change prices later, but a confirmed order keeps the price you paid. Payment is taken through the checkout on this website.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="terms_h_delivery">Delivery</h2>
    <p data-i18n="terms_delivery">Delivery is free on orders over €95. Delivery times on the site are estimates, not a guaranteed date. Risk in the parcel passes to you when the carrier marks it delivered to the address you gave.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="terms_h_use">How to use the products</h2>
    <p data-i18n="terms_use">Read the product page before use. These products are cosmetics, not medicine. Stop using a product if your skin reacts, and contact us. Queeny Lotion is not for pregnant women. Other products note who they are for on their page.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="terms_h_returns">Returns</h2>
    <p data-i18n="terms_returns">Returns and refunds follow the returns page. Opened or used products are not taken back, except when the item arrives damaged, wrong or faulty.</p>
    <p><a href="/pages/return-and-refund" data-i18n="footer_returns">Returns & refunds</a></p>

    <h2 data-i18n="terms_h_account">Your account</h2>
    <p data-i18n="terms_account">If you create an account, keep your login private. You are responsible for orders placed from your account.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="terms_h_site">The website</h2>
    <p data-i18n="terms_site">Photos, text and the Uniko Beauties name on this site belong to us. You may not copy them for your own shop. We may update the site, a product, or these terms. The version on this page is the current one.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="terms_h_liability">Limits</h2>
    <p data-i18n="terms_liability">We prepare products with care and describe them as accurately as we can. We are not responsible for results that depend on how a product is used, or for delays caused by the carrier. Nothing here removes rights you already have under the law where you live.</p>
  {% else %}
    <h1>{{ page.title }}</h1>
    <div class="uniko-policy-body rte">{{ page.content }}</div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .uniko-policy-page {
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: 48px 22px 88px;
  }

  .uniko-policy-page h1 {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #0d3d24;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .uniko-policy-page h2 {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #0d3d24;
    margin: 28px 0 8px;
  }

  .uniko-policy-page p,
  .uniko-policy-body {
    font-family: Montserrat, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #2c2c2c;
  }

  .uniko-policy-page p { margin: 0 0 12px; }

  .uniko-policy-contact {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 18px;
  }

  .uniko-policy-contact a,
  .uniko-policy-body a {
    color: #0d3d24;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Uniko page",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "uniko-page-section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
